{
  "id": "people-counter",
  "order": 12,
  "level": 3,
  "plant": null,
  "title": {
    "es": "Aforo de una sala",
    "en": "Room occupancy"
  },
  "statement": {
    "es": [
      "Una sala tiene un sensor en la ENTRADA (I0.0) y otro en la SALIDA (I0.1); cada uno da un pulso por persona. El aforo máximo es 3 personas.",
      "Con 3 o más personas adentro se enciende AFORO_COMPLETO (Q0.0). Con la sala vacía se enciende SALA_VACIA (Q0.1). Al empezar, la sala está vacía."
    ],
    "en": [
      "A room has a sensor at the ENTRANCE (I0.0) and another at the EXIT (I0.1); each gives one pulse per person. The maximum occupancy is 3 people.",
      "With 3 or more people inside, ROOM_FULL (Q0.0) turns on. With the room empty, ROOM_EMPTY (Q0.1) turns on. At start-up the room is empty."
    ]
  },
  "io": [
    {
      "address": "I0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "ENTRADA",
        "en": "ENTRANCE"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Sensor de entrada (1 pulso por persona)",
        "en": "Entrance sensor (1 pulse per person)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "SALIDA",
        "en": "EXIT"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Sensor de salida (1 pulso por persona)",
        "en": "Exit sensor (1 pulse per person)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "AFORO_COMPLETO",
        "en": "ROOM_FULL"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Letrero de aforo completo",
        "en": "Room full sign"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "SALA_VACIA",
        "en": "ROOM_EMPTY"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Luz de sala vacía",
        "en": "Room empty light"
      }
    }
  ],
  "allowed": ["NO", "NC", "coil", "CTU", "CTD", "CTUD", "EQ", "NE", "LT", "GT", "LE", "GE"],
  "hints": {
    "es": [
      "Necesitas contar hacia arriba con un sensor y hacia abajo con el otro.",
      "El contador CTUD tiene dos entradas: CU suma y CD resta. Su salida Q (QU) se activa cuando la cuenta CV llega a PV, y QD cuando CV es 0 o menos.",
      "Peldaño 1: ENTRADA → CTUD C0 (CD = SALIDA, PV = 3) → AFORO_COMPLETO. Peldaño 2: comparador C0.CV = 0 (o contacto C0.QD) → SALA_VACIA."
    ],
    "en": [
      "You need to count up with one sensor and down with the other.",
      "The CTUD counter has two inputs: CU adds and CD subtracts. Its output Q (QU) turns on when the count CV reaches PV, and QD when CV is 0 or less.",
      "Rung 1: ENTRANCE → CTUD C0 (CD = EXIT, PV = 3) → ROOM_FULL. Rung 2: comparison C0.CV = 0 (or contact C0.QD) → ROOM_EMPTY."
    ]
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Al empezar la sala está vacía",
        "en": "At start-up the room is empty"
      },
      "steps": [],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 300,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Con 3 personas el aforo está completo",
        "en": "With 3 people the room is full"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 400,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 500,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 700,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 800,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 600,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Las salidas descuentan hasta vaciar la sala",
        "en": "Exits count down until the room is empty"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 400,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 500,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 700,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 800,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1500,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1600,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1900,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 2000,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1400,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1800,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 2300,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
